o</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Cheng</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Wolff</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><name><surname>Yang</surname><given-names>NS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Particle bombardment-mediated gene transfer expression in rat brain tissue</article-title><source>Biotechnology</source><year>1993</year><volume>11</volume><fpage>497</fpage><lpage>502</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Biotechnology||11|497||bib9|'--></citation></ref><ref id="bib10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kobari</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Hisano</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Matsuno</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Sato</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Kan</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Tachibana</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Establishment of six human pancreatic cancer cell lines and their sensitivity to anti-tumour drugs</article-title><source>Tohoku J Exp Med</source><year>1986</year><volume>150</volume><fpage>231</fpage><lpage>248</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Tohoku J Exp Med||150|231||bib10|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3547771</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lehr</surname><given-names>HA</given-names></name><name><surname>Leunig</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Menger</surname><given-names>MD</given-names></name><name><surname>Nolte</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Messmer</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Dorsal skinfold chamber technique for intravital microscopy in nude mice</article-title><source>Am J Pathol</source><year>1993</year><volume>143</v